---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions — Syntexic AI Platform"
  description="Terms and conditions for using Syntexic AI articles, software developer utility tools, and benchmarking platform."
  activeNav="terms"
>
  <div class="legal-wrap">
    <div class="legal-header">
      <div class="legal-eyebrow">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="legal-title">Terms & Conditions</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last Updated: August 2, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-body">
      <h2>1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
      <p>By accessing or using Syntexic (syntexic.com), you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you disagree with any part of these terms, you may not access our services or interactive web tools.</p>

      <h2>2. Intellectual Property & Content License</h2>
      <p>Unless otherwise stated, Syntexic and/or its licensors own the intellectual property rights for all content, code samples, and benchmark data published on Syntexic. All intellectual property rights are reserved.</p>

      <h2>3. Permitted Use of AI & Developer Tools</h2>
      <p>Our interactive tools (Word Counter, JSON Formatter, Base64 Encoder, Meta Tag Analyzer, Color Contrast Checker, Screen Size Auditor) are provided free of charge for personal, educational, and commercial engineering use.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You may use our tools to format, analyze, and inspect your code and media assets.</li>
        <li>You must not attempt to reverse engineer or overload our edge infrastructure through automated malicious traffic.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Disclaimer of Liability</h2>
      <p>The materials and AI benchmark articles on Syntexic are provided on an 'as is' basis. Syntexic makes no warranties, expressed or implied, regarding accuracy or fitness for a particular purpose.</p>

      <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions regarding these Terms & Conditions, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hiddenlegacy.official@gmail.com" class="email-link">hiddenlegacy.official@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-wrap { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 24px 96px; }
  .legal-header { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 32px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
  .legal-eyebrow { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent-primary); margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .legal-title { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .legal-updated { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }

  .legal-body { font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #d4d4d8; }
  .legal-body h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary); margin: 40px 0 16px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .legal-body p { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .legal-body ul { margin: 0 0 24px 24px; }
  .legal-body li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .email-link { color: var(--accent-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
